---
id: KelolaJadwalPegawai-UbahJadwal
title: Kelola Jadwal Pegawai - Ubah Jadwal
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Manager
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as WorkerScheduleController
    participant WS as WorkerSchedule Model
    participant DB as Database

    HR->>UI: Klik tombol Edit pada jadwal tertentu
    UI->>C: GET /admin/worker-schedules/{id}
    C->>WS: Find jadwal dengan relasi
    WS->>DB: SELECT ws.*, w.name, w.nip, s.name as shift_name FROM ... WHERE ws.id = ?
    DB-->>WS: Schedule data
    WS-->>C: WorkerSchedule instance
    C-->>UI: Response dengan data
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form dengan data terpre-fill
    HR->>UI: Ubah shift/tanggal/catatan dan klik Simpan
    UI->>C: PUT /admin/worker-schedules/{id}
    note over C: Validasi: shift ada, tanggal valid, no overlap
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>WS: Update jadwal
        WS->>DB: UPDATE worker_schedules SET shift_id = ?, start_date = ?, end_date = ?, notes = ?, updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>WS: Jadwal berhasil diperbarui
        WS-->>C: Updated instance
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>HR: Notifikasi perubahan berhasil
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error
        UI-->>HR: Tampilkan pesan error
    end

